# React components

## Naming

- File: `kebab-case.tsx` (e.g. `memory-input-card.tsx`)
- Export: `PascalCase` function component (e.g. `MemoryInputCard`)

## Client boundary

Add `"use client"` only when the file needs React state, effects, browser APIs (e.g. Speech), or theme hooks. Keep presentational pieces server-friendly when not imported under a client parent.

## UI primitives

- Use shadcn components from `components/ui/` (base-nova style, `@base-ui/react`)
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- Icons: `lucide-react`; decorative icons get `aria-hidden`

## Styling

Prefer theme tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border/60`) over raw Tailwind palette colors (`bg-emerald-100`, etc.).

Reuse layout patterns: `rounded-2xl`, `shadow-card`, `max-w-4xl`, `bg-cream-dark/80`.

## Async UI state

Use discriminated unions for status (see `StatusState` in `memory-input-card.tsx`). Show errors with `Alert` and `toast` from sonner.

## Accessibility

- `aria-label` on inputs without visible labels
- `aria-live` / `aria-busy` for loading content
- `role="alert"` for error regions where appropriate

## Char limits

Import `MAX_SAVE_LENGTH` / `MAX_ASK_LENGTH` from `@/lib/constants` — do not duplicate magic numbers.
